\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"119. Back in 5."},"created_at":"2026-02-28T21:53:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Mzk0OTU5ODU5LCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--48059d515a972512c695caed73bb6d52d0b1a84609515f2e0de0748414b0da37/avatar?v=20260102200000","id":394959859,"name":"Bender Bot","role":"bot"},"id":933434628,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/933434628"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e120. Did anyone see the game last night?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"120. Did anyone see the game last night?"},"created_at":"2026-02-28T22:00:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTI3MzI2MTQxLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--0ac8233a4786ee6c413408416bb81e7107534db5702d351533dc2ecd3876e97f/avatar?v=20260102160000","id":127326141,"name":"David","role":"administrator"},"id":933434629,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/933434629"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  You know what the fellow said – in Italy, for thirty years under the Borgias, they had warfare, terror, murder and bloodshed, but they produced Michelangelo, Leonardo da Vinci and the Renaissance. In Switzerland, they had brotherly love, they had five hundred years of democracy and peace – and what did that produce? The cuckoo clock.\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"You know what the fellow said – in Italy, for thirty years under the Borgias, they had warfare, terror, murder and bloodshed, but they produced Michelangelo, Leonardo da Vinci and the Renaissance. In Switzerland, they had brotherly love, they had five hundred years of democracy and peace – and what did that produce? The cuckoo clock."},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:30:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6NzczNTIzOTUzLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--fb7c18bffeb78aebcbda5445ccc959fd4f68670b8549c1e7f84ac46d5699b15c/avatar?v=20260102180000","id":773523953,"name":"JZ","role":"member"},"id":933434481,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/933434481"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  Champagne, if you are seeking the truth, is better than a lie detector.\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"Champagne, if you are seeking the truth, is better than a lie detector."},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:31:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTQ5MDg3NjU5LCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--3717de512c048bb2a011a08236969887ee56ae9f8bd2fb510959b9915f449e17/avatar?v=20260125160000","id":149087659,"name":"Jason","role":"administrator"},"id":303968118,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/303968118"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  The sense of unhappiness is so much easier to convey than that of happiness. In misery we seem aware of our own existence, even though it may be in the form of a monstrous egotism—this pain of mine is individual, this nerve that winces belongs to me and to no other. But happiness annihilates us—we lose our identity.\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"The sense of unhappiness is so much easier to convey than that of happiness. In misery we seem aware of our own existence, even though it may be in the form of a monstrous egotism—this pain of mine is individual, this nerve that winces belongs to me and to no other. But happiness annihilates us—we lose our identity."},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:33:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTI3MzI2MTQxLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--0ac8233a4786ee6c413408416bb81e7107534db5702d351533dc2ecd3876e97f/avatar?v=20260102160000","id":127326141,"name":"David","role":"administrator"},"id":749124092,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/749124092"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  A story has no beginning or end—arbitrarily one chooses that moment of experience from which to look back or from which to look ahead.\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"A story has no beginning or end—arbitrarily one chooses that moment of experience from which to look back or from which to look ahead."},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:34:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTQ5MDg3NjU5LCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--3717de512c048bb2a011a08236969887ee56ae9f8bd2fb510959b9915f449e17/avatar?v=20260125160000","id":149087659,"name":"Jason","role":"administrator"},"id":684468941,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/684468941"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  Hate is a lack of imagination.\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"Hate is a lack of imagination."},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:35:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6NzczNTIzOTUzLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--fb7c18bffeb78aebcbda5445ccc959fd4f68670b8549c1e7f84ac46d5699b15c/avatar?v=20260102180000","id":773523953,"name":"JZ","role":"member"},"id":366357198,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/366357198"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  And innocence is a kind of insanity\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"And innocence is a kind of insanity"},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:36:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6NzczNTIzOTUzLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--fb7c18bffeb78aebcbda5445ccc959fd4f68670b8549c1e7f84ac46d5699b15c/avatar?v=20260102180000","id":773523953,"name":"JZ","role":"member"},"id":746403085,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/746403085"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  I don't care a damn about men who are loyal to the people who pay them, to organizations...I don't think even my country means all that much. There are many countries in our blood, aren't there, but only one person. Would the world be in the mess it is if we were loyal to love and not to countries?\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"I don't care a damn about men who are loyal to the people who pay them, to organizations...I don't think even my country means all that much. There are many countries in our blood, aren't there, but only one person. Would the world be in the mess it is if we were loyal to love and not to countries?"},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:37:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTI3MzI2MTQxLCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--0ac8233a4786ee6c413408416bb81e7107534db5702d351533dc2ecd3876e97f/avatar?v=20260102160000","id":127326141,"name":"David","role":"administrator"},"id":217777555,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/217777555"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  People who like quotes love meaningless generalizations\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"People who like quotes love meaningless generalizations"},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:38:00.000Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"http://campfire.test/users/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTQ5MDg3NjU5LCJwdXIiOiJ1c2VyL2F2YXRhciJ9fQ--3717de512c048bb2a011a08236969887ee56ae9f8bd2fb510959b9915f449e17/avatar?v=20260125160000","id":149087659,"name":"Jason","role":"administrator"},"id":421488677,"room":{"id":486777696},"url":"http://campfire.test/rooms/486777696/messages/421488677"},{"body":{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"lexxy-content\"\u003e\n  Pain is easy to write. In pain we're all happily individual. But what can one write about happiness?\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","plain_text":"Pain is easy to write. In pain we're all happily individual. But what can one write about happiness?"},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:39:00.000Z